{"title":"1312.5770 Consistency of Causal Inference under the Additive Noise Model","markdown":{"headingText":"1312.5770 Consistency of Causal Inference under the Additive Noise Model","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"- 作者/日期/来源：Samory Kpotufe, Eleni Sgouritsa, Dominik Janzing, Bernhard Schölkopf / arXiv:1312.5770（v3, 2014-02-05）\n- **一句话定位**：首次给出双变量加性噪声模型（Additive Noise Model, ANM）类因果推断方法在非参数情形下的统计一致性（consistency）证明，明确回归收敛、熵估计与噪声尾部条件如何共同保证正确判向概率趋于 1。\n- **研究问题**：已有工作（Shimizu 2006、Hoyer 2009、Peters 2011 等）证明了 ANM 的可识别性（soundness），但\"拟合两个方向 + 独立性检验\"这套元程序在有限样本下是否一致收敛没有被理论分析。\n- **模型与方法**：因果加性噪声模型（CAM，定义2）：X→Y 当且仅当 (i) Y=f(X)+η、η⊥⊥X，且 (ii) 对任意 g，残差 ηX,g = X−g(Y) 依赖于 X。方法族：估计 f_n、g_n 得残差，用基于熵的比较量 CXY = H(X)+H(ηY,f) 与 CYX = H(Y)+H(ηX,g) 判向（引理1：两者之差恰为互信息项 I(ηX,g;Y)−I(ηY,f;X)，故因果方向一侧复杂度严格更小），只需估计边缘分布而不必估计联合分布。区分两种方案：解耦估计（decoupled，回归用半份样本、熵估计用另一半）与耦合估计（coupled，全部在同一份样本上学习）。核心困难：残差 ηY,fn 是由输入本身估计出来的，即使 ‖fn−f‖_{L2}→0，ηY,fn 与 X 也可能呈现虚假依赖；引理3证明残差密度对 L2 距离的连续性，其收敛速率以指数 (α−1)/2α 依赖噪声尾部参数 α。\n- **主要命题/定理**：Assumption 1（回归 L2 一致、熵估计一致）与 Assumption 2（多项式尾 pη(t)≤C|t|^{−α}, α>1）。Theorem 1：解耦估计下，满足 Assumption 1–3（回归输出有界）即正确判定 X→Y 的概率 →1。Theorem 2：耦合估计下需指数尾噪声，取核回归带宽 h=c1n^{−α}、核密度熵估计带宽 σ=c2n^{−β}（β<min{(1−α)/4, α/2}，且 σ=Ω(Rn(gn)^{−γ})，即 σ 须大于回归误差以避免过拟合误差本身），一致性成立。模拟（N=1500，核回归/核岭回归）验证：回归类过富时耦合估计方差大而解耦稳健；限制类复杂度后耦合因样本利用更充分收敛更快；噪声尾部越衰减快收敛越快（图1）。\n- **在因果研究脉络中的角色**：把 ANM 因果发现从\"总体可识别\"推进到\"有限样本统计保证\"，与 Bühlmann et al. (2013) 的极大似然一致性结果互补；其熵比较量（以 H(X)+H(η) 作为方向复杂度）与\"机制与分布独立\"的信息几何视角一脉相承，为后续基于复杂度/信息论的因果方向判定提供了收敛性分析模板。\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","output-file":"1312.5770.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"目录","toc-title-website":"该页面内容","related-formats-title":"其他格式","related-notebooks-title":"笔记本","source-notebooks-prefix":"资源","other-links-title":"其他链接","code-links-title":"代码链接","launch-dev-container-title":"启动 Dev Container","launch-binder-title":"启动 Binder","article-notebook-label":"文章笔记本","notebook-preview-download":"下载笔记本","notebook-preview-download-src":"下载源代码","notebook-preview-back":"返回文章","manuscript-meca-bundle":"MECA 存档","section-title-abstract":"摘要","section-title-appendices":"附录","section-title-footnotes":"脚注","section-title-references":"参考文献","section-title-reuse":"二次使用","section-title-copyright":"版权","section-title-citation":"引用格式","appendix-attribution-cite-as":"请按如下格式引用：","appendix-attribution-bibtex":"BibTeX","appendix-view-license":"查看许可协议","title-block-author-single":"作者","title-block-author-plural":"作者","title-block-affiliation-single":"单位","title-block-affiliation-plural":"单位","title-block-published":"发布于","title-block-modified":"修改于","title-block-keywords":"关键词","callout-tip-title":"提示","ca